 4.95; ASB Standard 4.99. Three independent reads cluster on 4.99 and it matches the 13 Aug figure, so the tile is unchanged week on week.", "source": "interest.co.nz/borrowing carded rates table, DOM read live 17 Aug 2026"}, "cpi": {"annual_pct": 4.1, "quarter": "Jun 2026", "as_at": "2026-08-13", "confirmed": true, "detail": "Quarterly series. The Jun 2026 quarter print is current; the Sep quarter is not released until mid-Oct, so 4.1% is still live for the 20 Aug send. Carried forward WITH its original as-at date rather than restamped.", "source": "Stats NZ CPI release (confirmed 13 Aug 2026; not re-pulled, no new print due)"}, "_outstanding": {"hpi": "REINZ Market Intelligence, North Shore City (TA) monthly", "auction_clearance": "newest Friday deck via Google Drive"}}, "stats": {"captured": "2026-08-17", "source": "REINZ Location Profiler, POST /api/locations/salesstats/ {location_type_id:5, location_id:<id>} with Authorization: JWT <reinz-app-token>", "window": "LAST 12 MONTHS ONLY. Last-month fields deliberately not stored.", "min_sales_gate": 5, "suburbs": {"Albany Heights": {"sales": 34, "median": 1260000, "p25": 1020000, "p75": 1770000, "days": 57, "average": 1412962, "turnover": 0.02886}, "Bayswater": {"sales": 40, "median": 1550000, "p25": 906000, "p75": 1780000, "days": 56, "average": 1519900, "turnover": 0.02699}, "Bayview": {"sales": 126, "median": 923000, "p25": 845000, "p75": 1040000, "days": 42, "average": 949797, "turnover": 0.03236}, "Beach Haven": {"sales": 201, "median": 967000, "p25": 849000, "p75": 1100000, "days": 48, "average": 1014955, "turnover": 0.03651}, "Belmont": {"sales": 52, "median": 1300000, "p25": 1040000, "p75": 1580000, "days": 39, "average": 1601113, "turnover": 0.02277}, "Birkdale": {"sales": 177, "median": 896000, "p25": 779000, "p75": 1020000, "days": 48, "average": 913414, "turnover": 0.0388}, "Browns Bay": {"sales": 266, "median": 1230000, "p25": 985000, "p75": 1550000, "days": 39, "average": 1269783, "turnover": 0.03831},